  "details": "Everyone in the instance is suddenly being sent back to Homeworld with a \"connection time out\" error message.\nThe cause is unknown, but it has been happening several times in the past few days, and about once every three hours since this morning.\nI've checked with the people around me, and this error is occurring on both PC and VR.\nThe behavior is that while I am playing in the world, all the other players suddenly stop moving, and a few seconds later, the \"connection timeout\" menu screen appears, as mentioned at the top.",
